msgctxt "loc.Notes.Confirmation of Your Hotel Korso Reservation.title"
msgid "Confirmation of Your Hotel Korso Reservation"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Confirmation of Your Hotel Korso Reservation.content"
msgid ""
"Dear Tammi,\n"
"\n"
"We are delighted to confirm your reservation at Hotel Korso for your upcoming travel dates. Below are the details of your booking:\n"
"\n"
"- Guest Name: Iisakki Tammi\n"
"- Reservation Number: 62496712335\n"
"- Check-in Date: 1.1.1960\n"
"- Check-out Date: 1.1.1960\n"
"- Room Type: The boss's room\n"
"- Number of Guests: 1\n"
"- Total Cost: 1300 RM\n"
"\n"
"Please review the information above to ensure accuracy. Should you have any questions or require further assistance, feel free to contact our reservations team at 010 337 426 or reply to this email.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"We look forward to welcoming you to Hotel Korso and ensuring your stay is comfortable and enjoyable. Thank you for choosing us for your accommodation needs.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Warm regards,\n"
"\n"
"Karl Sheppern\n"
"Managing Director\n"
"Hotel Korso Obenseuer"
msgstr ""

