msgid "Muddy Markku Cigars at Unbeatable Prices!"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Muddy Markku Cigars at Unbeatable Prices!.content"
msgid ""
"Dear Tammi,\n"
"\n"
"We're having a sale on Muddy Markku Cigars! Now for a limited time only, indulge in mud without breaking the bank!\n"
"\n"
"Whether you're a cigar aficionado or just looking to try something new, now's the time to snag some quality sticks. Don't miss out!\n"
"\n"
"- Sent from MuddyMarkku.ts -\n"
"Merkki Street 52 B, Stalburg, Stolland"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Updated Security Measures.title"
msgid "Updated Security Measures"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Updated Security Measures.content"
msgid ""
"Dear Tammi,\n"
"\n"
"I wanted to inform you of recent security updates we've implemented at the bank. We've attached new lights to security cameras and installed doors that automatically close when the alarm is activated. Also, we have changed the vault access code to \"8888\" as requested.\n"
"\n"
"Feel free to reach out if you need further details.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Best regards,\n"
"\n"
"Heikki Mailanen"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Explorer's note about the new tunnel.title"
msgid "Explorer's note about the new tunnel"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Explorer's note about the new tunnel.content"
msgid ""
"Hey,\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"I told Hanss about the new tunnel that I managed to clear open. We're gearing up and planning to check it out together today.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"I warned that the entrance is a bit tight and several caves have collapsed in a short time but there's something about this one that feels different. Hanss sensed it too and he wants to go check it out soon as possible.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Maybe this is finally the route to the other side of the gate we've been looking for for a long time? If you're up for it, join us.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Stay sharp"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Explorer's note about the pipe.title"
msgid "Explorer's note about the pipe"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Explorer's note about the pipe.content"
msgid ""
"There's some noise coming from the area where the pipe goes. It's like an alarm or something.\n"
"\n"
"I tried squeezing through to get a closer look, but no luck. The cave narrows to a point where I would probably just get stuck. I'm not really keen on getting stuck underground like the guy whose body we found recently. It's like my worst nightmare.\n"
"\n"
"Hanss asked me to clear the tunnel that leads to the gate. I warned him that the tunnels have been collapsing more frequently recently. I'm probably going to with him next time he comes here."
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Guards's note.title"
msgid "Guards's note"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Guards's note.content"
msgid ""
"Hey,\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"So, I've gotta get something off my chest. Working at this dump has been driving me up the wall lately. You wouldn't believe the crap I have to put up here. I'm so tired of guarding those two cells.\n"
"\n"
"Always the same old faces end up here. Blabbering, yelling and other shit happens all the time. I can't watch TV in peace!\n"
"\n"
"And the stench coming from those cells could knock you out cold! Bucket toilets? Seriously?\n"
"\n"
"I have so many things to complain about! All the nonsense they talk to me, my lunch breaks are a disaster... I could go on and on with this list!\n"
"\n"
"I'm hoping that you could bring some sanity back to this place.\n"
"\n"
"December 25 - August 28."
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Prisoner's note.title"
msgid "Prisoner's note"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Prisoner's note.content"
msgid ""
"For the other inmates who have wandered in here.\n"
"\n"
"Caves\n"
"Ahead are caves that lead to an old water tunnel. Unfortunately it's a dead end! There is a floodgate that could perhaps be opened somehow from the other side. I don't know who dug those huge tunnels. Maybe old mines? Anyway, they're gone.\n"
"\n"
"Pipe room\n"
"The door is closed! I couldn't find a way to get out!\n"
"\n"
"I haven't found any way to get out!\n"
"\n"
"- L.H"
msgstr ""

