#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Mr. Bag Error.content"
msgid ""
"If Mr. Bag throws error code 3 24 8 22 please contact me immediately! That code is related to the self-defense mechanism which is only in the experimental stage. It can cause minor injury to someone if he is not treated!\n"
"\n"
"You don't have to worry about error code 10 26 14 2. It's just some small bug with Mr. Bag and it should not affect the system in any way!\n"
"\n"
"In any case, I hope you are happy with him! Isn't he handsome! I think he's absolutely gorgeous!"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Letter to Fredrik.title"
msgid "Letter to Fredrik"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Letter to Fredrik.content"
msgid ""
"Fredrik,\n"
"\n"
"I can't talk about this face to face so I decided to write a letter for you. I really want to share some concerns that have been weighing heavily on my mind lately.\n"
"\n"
"As you know, Pia has always been close to me, but she has become very dependent on me and I’m beginning to feel overwhelmed by the constant need to be her anchor. My own mental health is suffering, and I'm worried I won't be able to keep taking care of her.\n"
"\n"
"Can we find others to help Pia? I am grateful for your medicine, which has kept Pia in good health and I appreciate any help you can offer.\n"
"\n"
"- Alice"
msgstr ""

