#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Kolhola Rules.title"
msgid "Kolhola Rules"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Kolhola Rules.content"
msgid ""
"1. No noise after 18:00, and before 6:00\n"
"2. No loitering\n"
"3. No smoking\n"
"4. Strictly no posession, consumption and growing green mushrooms, and green mushroom derived products. Violators will be evicted immediately!!!\n"
"5. No drinking alcohol except during reserved sauna turns and between 18:00 and 21:00 on fridays and saturdays. Only 2 bottles of beer or equivalent allowed. Alcohol can only be drank in sauna or apartments.\n"
"6. production of alcohol is forbidden.\n"
"7. Defecation and urination forbidden except on toilets.\n"
"\n"
"Regards,\n"
"Kolhola resident committee"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Dumping Tunnel Warning.title"
msgid "Dumping Tunnel Warning"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Dumping Tunnel Warning.content"
msgid ""
"One of the spent fuel casks in the dumping tunnel have fallen and its lid has broken open spilling its contents. Now that tunnel is deadly radioactive. Even mere minutes in it are enough for a fatal dose, and you wouldn't feel anything! \n"
"\n"
"Don't go past the fence, or you will be a dead man walking!"
msgstr ""

