"-Bought the usual stuff. Weird mask. Gave us a duck which we put on the shelf\n"
"\n"
"Bleeding woman\n"
"-I called an ambulance! She said she just needs bandages\n"
"\n"
"Lilly Cooper\n"
"-My former classmate! Asked some weird questions from Patrik\n"
"\n"
"Mumbling woman\n"
"-Gave us a recipe for apple pie!?\n"
"\n"
"Weird guy who smelled like an old sock that has been swimming in a bucket of dead fish\n"
"-Bought over 30 packages of condoms!\n"
"\n"
"Priest\n"
"-He bought painkillers and other medicines that help with fungal disease\n"
"\n"
"Tall man\n"
"-Stood quietly and watched the surveillance camera for 10 minutes\n"
"\n"
"Weirdo\n"
"-Asked for a phone number"
msgstr ""

