#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.A page from Joel's diary.title"
msgid "A page from Joel's diary"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.A page from Joel's diary.content"
msgid ""
"She’s become so deeply religious in such a short time, and it’s consuming her. She doesn't let me in. It's like she is hiding something or someone. I tried to talk her about it but she just said I wouldn't understand.\n"
"\n"
"I need to talk to her before she does something irreversible."
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Joel's list.title"
msgid "Joel's list"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Joel's list.content"
msgid ""
"What we know\n"
"-Probably hidden somewhere in small storage\n"
"-Contains also other valuable items\n"
"-Is that place cursed? We have to be careful!\n"
"\n"
"Plan\n"
"-We have to get keys\n"
"-Only take what we are looking for!\n"
"-Crowbar and flashlight\n"
"-Must not be caught!"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Religious letter.title"
msgid "Religious letter"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Religious letter.content"
msgid ""
"Dear Brothers and Sisters in Faith,\n"
"\n"
"I write to you today, seeking your understanding, forgiveness, and prayers.\n"
"\n"
"I regret to inform you that I have let my inner evil loose again. In a moment of uncontrollable rage, I took the life of another and now I'm tormented by the guilt of my actions.\n"
"\n"
"I come to you, my spiritual family, to ask atone my sins and to help the victim's shadow reach peace on the other side.\n"
"\n"
"Let us live in peace in the realm of shadows,\n"
"\n"
"Hietala"
msgstr ""

