"Notice!\n"
"\n"
"Elevator is out of service, electrician has been dispatched to troubleshoot the issue."
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.B2 note.title"
msgid "B2 note"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.B2 note.content"
msgid ""
"It still breaks sometimes! \n"
"\n"
"It started to move on its own yesterday and I have no idea why. I feel like it's cursed or something. \n"
"\n"
"Maybe I use something else than mannequins! Also that hallway is not even long enough. B2 was atleast three times longer. \n"
"\n"
"Maybe change door password to 4027?\n"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.B3 storage.title"
msgid "B3 storage"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.B3 storage.content"
msgid ""
"I'm hearing breathing in the B3 storage! \n"
"\n"
"That place must be also cursed! I'm going to make sure that thing is going to stay there so I'm going to brick the door and also take that handwheel from the flood door. Whatever it is even. I still remember what happened in that tunnel near Hammer Valley. I don't want to that same thing happen here in Obenseuer tunnels.\n"
"\n"
"-Robin"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Bergmann tunnel floodgates.title"
msgid "Bergmann tunnel floodgates"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Bergmann tunnel floodgates.content"
msgid ""
"Notice!\n"
"\n"
"It seems that Robin fellow changed the flood door settings, because the flood sensors didn't work anymore. So now you have to close the floodgates that are connected to this tunnel and also open main 02. Remember also check those fuses at control room!\n"
"\n"
"-Mike, new Bergmann tunnel worker"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Control room fuses.title"
msgid "Control room fuses"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Control room fuses.content"
msgid ""
"Slot 1 (Left): Floodgates control A1\n"
"Slot 2: Floodgates control A2\n"
"Slot 3: Microwave\n"
"Slot 4: B3"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Bergmann tunnels condition.title"
msgid "Bergmann tunnels condition"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Bergmann tunnels condition.content"
msgid ""
"They have renovated bergmann tunnels everywhere except here in Obenseuer and things are getting worse every day. I'm probably not going to be able to come here soon, because of that fungal disease. \n"
"\n"
"Anyway, I still have a lot of things to get fixed here, because that previous Bergmann tunnel worker Robin broke everything! Like that flood door at the bottom! You have to close floodgates that leads to that tunnel and open main 02 to get that flood door open.\n"
"\n"
"-Mike"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Flood door sign.title"
msgid "Flood door sign"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Flood door sign.content"
msgid ""
"NOTICE\n"
"\n"
"LIGHTS\n"
"\n"
"If the light is red, the area behind the door may be flooded, or the door may be having technical difficulties. The flood door cannot be opened when the light is red.\n"
"\n"
"If the light is green, the area behind the door is not flooded and is safe for entry. The flood door can ONLY be opened when the light is green.\n"
"\n"
"WARNING\n"
"\n"
"DO NOT BE UNDER THE FLOOD DOOR WHILE IT IS CLOSING. IT MAY CAUSE SERIOUS INJURY OR DEATH.\n"
"\n"
"TWSC\n"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Hiding SMV patients.title"
msgid "Hiding SMV patients"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Hiding SMV patients.content"
msgid "Some patients escaped from the quarantine area."
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Deekula A Storage.title"
msgid "Deekula A Storage"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Deekula A Storage.content"
msgid "You can take what you want from here, but don't break the boxes or anything!"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Deekula A8 Storage.title"
msgid "Deekula A8 Storage"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Deekula A8 Storage.content"
msgid ""
"You were wrong!\n"
"\n"
"My product was not completely clean! Damn!\n"
"\n"
"I don't know how they did it. Maybe your instructions were incorrect? I used the substances that were in your instructions and that's why I'm in trouble! I smoked that stuff myself because I trusted you! \n"
"\n"
"I'm going to die!"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Hiding fungal disease patients.title"
msgid "Hiding fungal disease patients"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Hiding fungal disease patients.content"
msgid ""
"There are rumors that some patients escaped from the quarantine area and they're now hiding with normal people. Some of them cover their faces with masks and and keep a low profile. There are some cases that are well known, but no one is completely sure if they really suffered from fungal disease or if there's some other reasons why they wear a mask.\n"
"\n"
"They can also be patients who have managed to overcome the fungal disease completely, but their faces have suffered some cosmetic damage. They may also have suffered severe brain damage and I recommend to be careful near them because they can behave unpredictably."
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Letter to Krista.title"
msgid "Letter to Krista"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Letter to Krista.content"
msgid ""
"Dear Krista,\n"
"\n"
"Unfortunately I have to stay on sick leave. I have read all your messages and I know that you're worried about things that has happened in Stalburg and especially here in Obenseuer. Sadly even I don't have answers to all this.\n"
"\n"
"I have heard about this \"other side\" and I have to investigate it more, before I can say anything about it. I assure you that everything happens according to the will of God.\n"
"\n"
"We just have to be patient and pray.\n"
"\n"
"- Father Tobias"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Letter to Priest.title"
msgid "Letter to Priest"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Letter to Priest.content"
msgid ""
"If you're reading this letter you are probably cured or at least doing better. I'm going to leave this letter here, because I don't know if I'm coming back. I gave you an experimental drug while you were unconscious. I'm sorry I did that without your permission, but it was my only way to try save you. I hope you are not angry with me.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for taking care of my father in his last moments.\n"
"\n"
"- The girl next door"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Neighbour.title"
msgid "Neighbour"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Neighbour.content"
msgid ""
"My neighbour knows what happened to me and she promised to help me. She doesn't want to tell anyone her name, but she revealed to me that she was part of Stalburg Underground group. I have heard bad things about them, but she seems be completely different if those rumors are true. \n"
"\n"
"I know that I can trust her and I don't really have other choice, because she's my only hope to cure my sickness. I know that it's not going to be easy for her. \n"
"\n"
"I feel worse day by day. I can't leave from my aparment anymore. If someone would see me in this condition, they would move me to an isolated zone.\n"
" \n"
"Only thing I can do is pray and hope that God is merciful to me. This pain inside is making me want to do things I would never think I would do. God forgive me.\n"
"\n"
"- Father Tobias"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Osrat device.title"
msgid "Osrat device"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Osrat device.content"
msgid ""
"It looks like that Osrat can't get signals withouth the amulet. It's from the other side so it's probably still connected there on some level. It feels like something is pulling it to the other side. Maybe it's those red stones that causes it.\n"
"\n"
"Best places to get connection is near the dead bodies, but sometimes it doesn't seem to be true. It starts beeping when it has a strong connection and then you can try to travel to the other side. I just haven't been able to find a strong enough signal to get deeper than a state they call a \"black noise\". I probably need a bigger transmitter or a place that has a very strong connection if I want to get any further."
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Relocation note to Deekula B9 residents.title"
msgid "Relocation note to Deekula B9 residents"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Relocation note to Deekula B9 residents.content"
msgid ""
"Dear Deekula B9 residents.\n"
"\n"
"The authorities of the city of Stalburg has decided to relocate all the residents of the apartment B9 to a new location that will be announced when the transfer will take place. \n"
"\n"
"You have one day to take your main items with you. Please, don't take more items than you can handle and be prepared to show your passports to the authorities. If you do not have the passport, you will be still relocated and the authorities will help you get your passport. The inclusion of all products of mushroom origin is prohibited. Contact the authorities for more information.\n"
"\n"
"The reason for this transfer is due to overpopulation in the area, vacant space on the other side of Obenseuer district and ensuring safe and healthy housing for city residents.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for your understanding.\n"
"\n"
"- Authorities of the city of Stalburg and fungal disease treatment unit"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Henchman note.title"
msgid "Henchman note"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Henchman note.content"
msgid ""
"The boss gonna be released from prison anyday now. Knowing him, he's likely very angry and bonkers when he gets back.\n"
"\n"
"I managed to get bottle of Sukka Junior, that expensive quality wine stuff, what I saw on Zigzag video.\n"
"\n"
"I left nicely wrapped gift in his penthouse.\n"
"\n"
"Make sure to clean the penthouse before the big boss gets back.\n"
"\n"
"Doorcode:\n"
"- Shroom automat\n"
"- Boarded aparment with weird lanterns\n"
"- Storage with Stalburg flag\n"
"- Bricked apartment you can see into"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Letter to Hans.title"
msgid "Letter to Hans"
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Letter to Hans.content"
msgid ""
"Hanss,\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"That radio message you sent really helped me locate the place. I have reason to believe that he is likely inside, but the gates are closed. It appears that the entire place has been abandoned or, perhaps, sealed off intentionally. Unfortunately, the keypad appears to be without power, rendering me unable to enter the required code. Something is terribly wrong and I don't like it. That radio message doesn't make me feel any better.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"I think there must be some other way in, probably hidden in those old mine tunnels. The thing is, I don't have a clue where to start looking. I stumbled upon an old map from some guy who used to work at SNW, but it's not shedding any light on where that second entrance might be.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"This situation is getting pretty complicated, and I share your unease about it. I'm going to keep searching and try to figure out what's going on here, so you can finally get the answers you've been looking for.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Be careful."
msgstr ""

#: Notes
msgctxt "loc.Notes.Long test placeholder note with long placeholder text.title"
msgid "Long test placeholder note with long placeholder text"
msgstr ""

